# When INBOX is renamed by another program while the panel is open, the destination is gone: Enter adds nothing.
file <<END
INBOX:
	- Old item
Work:
END
keys qi
type Keep me
see Quick Add → INBOX
outside <<END
Inbox:
	- Old item
Work:
END
status Reloaded
see Choose a project with /
see - Keep me
keys <Enter>
see Choose a project with /
keys <Space> /
type wor
keys <Enter> <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
Inbox:
	- Old item
Work:
	- Keep me
END
